   z-lab/Qwen3.8-27B-DFlash2 (Apache-2.0), atdev-company/Qwen3.8-27B-atdev-c1.

Additional data provenance (2026-11-01)

The clean drafter prompt sources are HuggingFaceH4/ultrachat_200k (train_sft, MIT)
and openai/gsm8k (main/train, MIT). Clean2 token-order statistics add 4,000
UltraChat prompts with target-generated responses.
The accuracy-recovered c32 development sidecar additionally uses sampled
FineWeb-2 Korean and FineWeb-Edu English for GPTQ calibration. Contains
information from FineWeb-2 and FineWeb-Edu, made available by Hugging Face
